  2. Monk JD, Beuchat LR, Doyle MP. Irradiation inactivation of food-borne
     microorganisms. Journal of Food Protection 1995;58:197-208.
  3. Gold HS, Moellering RC. Antimicrobial-drug resistance. N Engl J Med
